{"root":"cemas","ipa":"/tʃəmas/","core":"感到不安、焦虑、担忧，通常指对未来或未知情况的忧虑。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃəmas/","zh":"焦虑的，担心的","phrases":[{"t":"merasa cemas","zh":"感到焦虑"},{"t":"sangat cemas","zh":"非常担心"},{"t":"cemas akan masa depan","zh":"对未来感到忧虑"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia merasa cemas menunggu hasil ujiannya.","zh":"他在等待考试结果时感到很焦虑。"},{"t":"Jangan cemas, semuanya akan baik-baik saja.","zh":"别担心，一切都会好起来的。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"cemas","ipa":"/tʃəmas/","zh":"焦虑的","phrase":{"t":"wajah cemas","zh":"焦虑的面容"},"example":{"t":"Ibu tampak cemas melihat anaknya sakit.","zh":"母亲看到孩子生病显得很焦虑。"}},{"w":"kecemasan","ipa":"/kətʃəmasan/","zh":"焦虑（名词）","phrase":{"t":"tingkat kecemasan","zh":"焦虑水平"},"example":{"t":"Dia menderita kecemasan yang berlebihan.","zh":"他患有过度焦虑症。"}},{"w":"mencemaskan","ipa":"/məntʃəmaskan/","zh":"使人担忧的；为……感到担忧","phrase":{"t":"situasi yang mencemaskan","zh":"令人担忧的局势"},"example":{"t":"Kondisi kesehatannya sangat mencemaskan keluarga.","zh":"他的健康状况让家人非常担忧。"}}],"derSlugs":["cemas","kecemasan","mencemaskan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:02:18.165Z","src":"base"}